WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.316
The responsible choice is provisional.

00:00:02.316 --> 00:00:09.262
Record the audience, the situation, the likely barrier and the result you hope to improve.

00:00:09.262 --> 00:00:13.894
Label unresolved evidence and say what could change your decision.

00:00:13.894 --> 00:00:18.525
A polished AI explanation does not prove the need exists.

00:00:18.525 --> 00:00:22.230
Save this reasoning in your continuing project record.
